<p>Coordinator-based multi-agent systems are powerful=E2=80=94but not free.=
</p>
<p>In large retail environments, the trade-off is often worth it: sacrifici=
ng raw speed to gain reuse, ownership clarity, and organizational scalabili=
ty. The critical skill is not choosing <em>the</em> right pattern, but <str=
ong>understanding and managing the trade-offs intentionally</strong>.</p>
        </div><!-- .entry-content -->

